{"title":"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b28547efd22be1c4a05fa193cd7038fc65d71b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are positive <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Real_number\" title=\"Real number\">real numbers</a> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/1/2319da78379b2c0fbb8658a6c06e038fe6815ad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(b+c) = 152, b(c+a) = 162,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"238\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/3/de348d669a695e9a9d1b119ead29ba132eb01c93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c(a+b) = 170$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96a81938ca5e71faa6894d9d52ac776c9efbe75d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/4/8343d8ce9540602a525c393f8cdce7be5185a44b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 672 \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 688 \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 704 \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 720 \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 750$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"432\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adding up the three equations gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/9/0491ca43a6d9cdda9c21e252199398e2e8b8e57c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(ab + bc + ca) = 152 + 162 + 170 = 484 \\Longrightarrow ab + bc + ca = 242$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"505\" height=\"18\" />. Subtracting each of the above equations from this yields, respectively, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/c/f5c73b638980f2bad48330f34358983cb98ba188.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bc = 90, ca = 80, ab = 72$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"193\" height=\"16\" />. Taking their product, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/3/dc3ad0f1680bd7ce13b38753298ca93389c7c234.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab \\cdot bc \\cdot ca = a^2b^2c^2 = 90 \\cdot 80 \\cdot 72 = 720^2 \\Longrightarrow abc = \\boxed{720} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"495\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expand the system and subtract equation 3 from equation 2 to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/6/b46dc72f73c67e33bc927d6e55e95183af0f0708.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab-ac=-8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />, and add it to the first equation to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/9/799fcd3ebf82a1dad2415bbb09a7a487c8106082.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab=144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/1/981cc6a2adc50878a6da811d05c34e5cfaf6cef7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Longrightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/9/9e97e9eae7c7abe84d29a76dd3cffd6da4bc1b3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab=72.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"14\" /> Since we want <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/a/57acc175ea980f07a060a776d42c83e92acf2c0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> it's trivial that 72 is a factor of this. We can quickly see that none of the answer choices have the factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94db15b430439ad5b3c80bfacfef0c6499ede2ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> except choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/8/1d8dd2ace620fb9d4035c8e9addfe8427569654b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"46\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~dbnl\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_.28English-Chinese_Bilingual.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/QRE90xOBf4I\">https://youtu.be/QRE90xOBf4I</a>\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B\">2002 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=